BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20210703T200000Z
DTEND:20210703T210000Z
SUMMARY:OSArch Monthly Meetup #16: Xeokit by Xeolabs
URL:https://meet.jit.si/openbim
DESCRIPTION:Great to host Lindsay Kay from xeolabs in our upcoming July's monthly meetup! As the lead developer of xeokit, Lindsay will talk about this open-source web programming toolkit that has been developed for visualizing 3D BIM models in the browser and that is currently used by a number of leading BIM platforms in the AEC industry.
END:VEVENT
